 "about_text": "Band of Vices is a Los Angeles gallery founded in 2015 by Terrell Tilford, who began it as a downtown pop-up before opening a permanent space in West Adams and later relocating to the Arts District. The gallery describes itself as growing from an artistic collaborative into an internationally recognized platform, with a stated mission of inclusion and support for artists who have historically been overlooked, including Black, brown, queer, and differently abled voices. Its program centers on emerging and mid-career contemporary artists with strong individual visions, and the gallery has built an international following through exhibitions, art fairs, and press coverage over the past decade.",
